<title>ITALY: Italian Dec car registrations rose 12.14 pct.</title>
<headline>Italian Dec car registrations rose 12.14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian new car registrations rose 12.14 percent to 111,000 units in December, compared with 98,983 in December 1995, the Ministry of Transport said.</p>
<p>For November 1996, the Ministry had announced an 11.44 percent fall to 134,000 units.</p>
